<title>RUSSIA: Russia Q1 non-CIS nickel exports jump 48 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russia Q1 non-CIS nickel exports jump 48 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia boosted nickel exports to countries outside the Commonwealth of Independent States (CIS) to 50,300 tonnes in the first quarter of 1997, up 48 percent on the same year-ago period, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The committee also said non-CIS primary aluminium exports edged up three percent to 651,000 tonnes in the January-to-March period.</p>
<p>Copper exports outside the CIS rose 16 percent during the first three months of 1997 on year-ago levels to 136,000 tonnes, the committee said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
